.\n\nVerified with `python3 -m unittest` (16 tests, all passing) as well as additional edge-case checks across all modules.\n","duration_seconds":284.866968785,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":71506,"output_tokens":34914,"thinking_tokens":20644,"cache_read_tokens":160275,"total_tokens":106420}}}
